<section id="about">
  <div class="about-left">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">Studio</p>
    <h2 class="about-headline reveal reveal-delay-1">
      Not one fixed thing.<br />Never a template.
    </h2>
    <p class="about-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
      Arklo is a web design studio built on a simple belief: every brand deserves a presence that's fully its own. We
      don't apply the same solution twice. We observe, listen, and shape — differently every time.
    </p>
    <p class="about-body reveal reveal-delay-3">
      We work with founders, creatives, and growing companies who know that a great website isn't a page — it's an
      argument. We help you make yours.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-right">
    <div class="arclo-quote reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <p>
        At one moment <strong>the eyes</strong> — inspecting what your audience actually needs.<br />
        At another <strong>the mouth</strong> — speaking your brand's words with clarity and force.<br />
        And so at times <strong>the spread</strong> — a presence that travels, persists, and lives.
      </p>
